The '''Klatooinian wikiup''' was the home base of a [[Klatooinian]] [[Klatooinian raiders|tribe]]<ref name="DB">{{Databank|klatooinian-wikiup|Klatooinian wikiup}}</ref> on [[Sorgan]]<ref name="Mandalorian4" /> in [[9 ABY]].<ref name="Date" /> Located near a [[Unidentified village (Sorgan)|village]], the Klatooinians would attack a [[human]] [[Unidentified human tribe|tribe]] of [[krill farmer]]s there, steal their [[Krill (creature)|krill]], and take it back to the outpost to brew into [[spotchka]]. When [[Din Djarin]] and [[Carasynthia Dune]] were hired to protect the human tribe, they attacked and destroyed the Klatooinian outpost.<ref name="Mandalorian4" /> The raiders' krill, spotchka, and other spoils littered the wikiup.<ref name="DB" />

==Behind the scenes==
The Klatooinian wikiup first appeared in "[[Chapter 4: Sanctuary]]," the fourth episode of [[Jon Favreau]]'s [[2019]] [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: The Mandalorian]]''. The episode was directed by [[Bryce Dallas Howard]]<ref name="Mandalorian4" /> and released on [[November 29]], [[2019]].<ref name="TV date">{{WebCite|url=https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/documents/the_mandalorian_project_one-sheet_10_ec1e005f.pdf|text=The Mandalorian Media Kit|date=2019-09-24|format=[[Wikipedia:PDF|PDF]]|work=[[Wikipedia:Walt Disney Direct-to-Consumer & International|Walt Disney Direct-to-Consumer & International]]|pages=[https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/documents/the_mandalorian_project_one-sheet_10_ec1e005f.pdf#page=1]|archivedate=20210623202717}}</ref> It was subsequently identified in its [[StarWars.com]] [[Databank (2014-)|Databank]] entry.<ref name="DB" />

